        "Content": "Roadside cottage on C. 1.2 acres, situated in a peaceful rural setting offering excellent potential for those seeking a renovation project. \n\nAccommodation comprises of Living room, Kitchen, 3 Bedrooms and a Bathroom.\n\nThis property has a water connection, electricity will need to be re-connected septic tank is on site.\n\nThe property is located approx. 4km from Manorhamilton and 21km from Kinlough.\n\nThe Cottage should qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant Scheme (subject to terms conditions - check government websites for further details under vacant property refurbishment grants)\n\nHighlights\n? Folio LM16180F consisting of circa 1.2 acres (0.51 ha).\n? Quiet, secluded location\n? Large site which may offer development potential (subject to planning permission)\n? Off street parking\n? Septic tank on site\n? Excellent refurbishment opportunity\n? Subject to terms and conditions, may qualify for local authority and energy grants\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only through the sole selling agent.\n"
